  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young African Leaders Initiative (YALI) | CARVI Beef Jerky Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within five years, I see this initiative as the leader in agri-business in Africa. I see it playing a big role in this field and making his products available to the world. I see it having a social impact of greater and greater importance by offering his support to young local producers who have naturally faced the same challenges. Our mission is to contribute to food security, the financial independence of farmers and the eradication of hunger in Africa. Carvi Food is currently in food processing via beef jerky production. However, the company does not intend to stay at this stage. Its ambition is to evolve by taking control of the entire process from meat production to the implementation of a solid distribution system, established both at national and international level.</narrative>
  </description>
